about:
Ernst & Young is a global leader in assurance, tax, transactions and advisory services. 
We aim to have a positive impact on business and markets, as well as on society as a whole. Therefore, we strive to offer global solutions to global problems our clients face.

As a partner at Ernst & Young, I have a broad experience serving international as well as local audit clients in a wide variety of industry sectors but with a strong focus on ports and shipping, mining and family businesses.

I am a Certified Public Accountant and Member of the Belgian Institute of Certified Public Accountants (IBR/IRE).

Throughout my career I gained experience in the following areas of expertise:
- USGAAP accounting and US GAAS auditing;
- IFRS accounting, IFRS conversion;
- SOX-404 internal control environment;
- internal audit;
- audit experience in an international environment (worked for Ernst & Young USA in Chicago);
- experience in IPO projects (including UK market).

